1
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,380
拿那么多酸奶干什么
What's with all the yogurt?

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:09,260
嘘 德卡斯一直私自开我的储物柜
Shh! Durkas has been breaking into my locker.

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,300
但我想出了一个复仇计划
But I've got a little revenge planned.

4
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,000
不好意思 我其实没兴趣知道
Sorry. I just remembered I don't really care.

5
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,300
妈妈呢 噢 天呐 你穿的是什么
Where's Mom? Oh, my God, what is that outfit?

6
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,560
你不会要走哥特路线吧
Are you going goth?

7
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,146
你现在还抱着毛绒熊猫睡觉呢
You still sleep with a stuffed panda.

8
00:00:22,146 --> 00:00:24,000
你滚去参加大学联谊会吧
Don't you have a fraternity to pass out in?

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,520
你那个小手术 还需要点什么东西吗
Is there anything else you need for your procedure?

10
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,480
我想来点冰激凌
Um, I think I'm supposed to have ice cream.

11
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:29,980
是吗 可我觉得...
Hmm. Actually, I don't--

12
00:00:29,991 --> 00:00:31,840
不好意思 到底是切你的输卵管
I'm sorry. Is it a vasecto-you,

13
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,160
还是切我的输精管
Or a vasectomy?

14
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:34,940
-到时给你买个冰激凌 -谢谢
- You can have ice cream. - Thanks.

15
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:37,734
-今天...-要切个东东
- Today... - Snip-a-dee-doo-dah!

16
00:00:37,734 --> 00:00:39,847
我们讨论了有段日子了
We-we've been talking about doing this for a while.

17
00:00:39,847 --> 00:00:41,660
没错 没错 自从爸和歌洛莉亚
Yeah. Yeah, ever since dad and Gloria

18
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:42,560
不小心搞出个孩子
had their little accident,

19
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:43,880
我们不需要那种惊喜了
we don't need any surprises.

20
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:44,860
而且
Also, though,

21
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:47,140
以后在闺房中也可以多一些"自由发射"
it will allow for a little more freestylin' in the boudoir

22
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,080
因为不必再担心搞出个小生命出来
If we're not having to worry about adding more critters.

23
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:50,320
更重要的是
More importantly,

24
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:52,729
那是我们五年计划的关键部分
it is an essential part of our 5-year plan.

25
00:00:52,729 --> 00:00:55,527
噢 五年计划 跟他们说说罗斯夫妇吧
Oh, the 5-year plan. Talk about the--the Rosses.

26
00:00:55,538 --> 00:00:56,600
罗斯夫妇 好吧
The Rosses--okay,

27
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,080
罗斯夫妇是我们的老朋友
the Rosses are this couple we have known forever, and...

28
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:01,140
他们生不了小孩
They were never able to have kids,

29
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:03,760
-所以我们对他们有点... -嫉妒
- So we always felt a little... - jealous of them.

30
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:04,700
我们很爱我们的孩子
I mean, we love our kids,

31
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:06,580
但约翰和克丽希有时间旅行
But John and Chrissy can travel...

32
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,620
他们的皮肤长年是健康的棕色
They're always tan.

33
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:10,680
你看得出克丽希比我大8岁吗
Did you know that Chrissy is eight years older than me?

34
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,441
要我说 她比你年轻8岁还差不多
I would have said eight years younger.

35
00:01:12,441 --> 00:01:14,400
她身上迸发出的青春火花...
There's just this spark in her that--

36
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,080
真是 瞧瞧我身边的这位 你以前也有的
Well, look who I'm talking to. You used to have it.

37
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,140
-你好像没...听到我说 -我要说的是
- Wow. It's like you don't... hear... - The point is,

38
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:19,840
只要我们不再造个新人
As long as we don't have another baby,

39
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,300
5年后我们也可以享受那样的生活
That life is ours in five years

40
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:23,520
到时候卢克已经离家上大学了
When Luke goes off to college.

41
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,400
或者别的地方
Or somewhere.

42
00:01:24,471 --> 00:01:28,688
我今天其实是开开心心地去医生那儿的
It will actually be a pleasure walking into that doctor's office today

43
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:30,600
你终于来了 妈
There you are. Mom--

44
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,260
等等 你这是什么行头
Hang on a second. What is this?

45
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:34,720
是受了你那位叫斯凯勒的朋友的影响吗
Is this because of your new friend Skyler?

46
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:36,700
她正努力改变形象
Oh, she's just trying to change her image.

47
00:01:36,980 --> 00:01:37,800
顺便说下 挺有成效的
Nice work, by the way.

48
00:01:37,820 --> 00:01:39,480
你已经从呆瓜升级到呆鸭了
You went from dork to Count Dorkula.

49
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:42,120
能聊聊我的衣服吗 我早就让你寄过来的
Can we talk about my clothes? You were supposed to send them!

50
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:43,560
我等会儿再说你的事 等一下
I'll be with you in a second. Hang on.

51
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,280
我不喜欢那个斯凯勒
I don't like this Skylar.

52
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:47,000
你不必非得改变自己
You don't need to change who you are

53
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,040
来迎合那些酷小孩
to fit in with the cool kids.

54
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:51,520
她当然得变了 她实在是太土了
Oh, of course she does. She just is so uncool,

55
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:52,940
她都分不清谁是酷小孩
she doesn't know who the cool kids are.

56
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:54,560
你难道不要忙着挂科吗
Don't you have a class to fail?

57
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:56,240
你不需要去训练乌鸦吗[哥特风]
Don't you have a raven to train?

58
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:59,540
听着 我这周强调了两遍衣服的事儿
Listen, I have repeated outfits twice this week.

59
00:01:59,580 --> 00:02:01,840
-我受不了了 -我明天会替你解决的
- It's a disaster. - And I will deal with it tomorrow,

60
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:03,560
但今天我要带你爸去见医生
But today I'm taking your father to the doctor.

61
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:06,440
-他要做个屁股切除术 -什么
- He's having an ass-ectomy. - What?

62
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:08,760
-我耳朵很灵的 -你要切扁挑体吗
- I hear things. - You're getting your tonsils out?

63
00:02:08,760 --> 00:02:11,046
我看我们家需要来个"笨蛋切除术"
Ohh! This family needs a dumbass-ectomy.

64
00:02:11,046 --> 00:02:13,250
闭嘴 你总以为自己多...
Oh, shut up! I'm tired of you thinking you're so...

65
00:02:13,250 --> 00:02:14,795
爸没跟你说过你其实是被领养的吗
Did dad ever tell you you were adopted?

66
00:02:14,795 --> 00:02:16,360
-不 我才不是 -再忍五年
- No, I wasn't! - Five more years.

67
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:16,740
好的
Okay.

68
00:02:31,140 --> 00:02:32,540
好吧 那么放学后
Okay, so after school,

69
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:34,360
你和朋友艾希莉去游泳
You're going to your friend Ashley's to swim,

70
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,240
所以我要你现在去准备你的泳衣
So I'm gonna need you to go get your swimsuit,

71
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:38,640
你的泳镜还有防晒油 好吗
Your swim goggles, and your sunscreen, okay?

72
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,460
然后换个没粘猫毛的衣服
And change into a dress that's not covered in cat fur.

73
00:02:41,460 --> 00:02:43,540
那猫掉毛掉的厉害
Oh, that cat is really losing its hair.

74
00:02:43,540 --> 00:02:46,140
或许我们该给它抹点你的防脱发剂
Maybe we should slip it one of your propecia, huh?

75
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:47,580
什么防脱发剂
What propecia?

76
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:49,920
你的防...
Your pro--

77
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:52,500
那不是我们...
Is that not something that we're...

78
00:02:53,149 --> 00:02:54,929
所以 你今天打算做什么
So, uh, what you got going on today?

79
00:02:54,929 --> 00:02:56,700
忙 忙 忙得抓狂
Ohh. Busy, busy, busy, busy.

80
00:02:56,700 --> 00:02:58,740
我可能得买些灯泡 然后时间允许的话
I might buy some light bulbs, and then, if time permits,

81
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:01,240
我也许要继续搞我的大项目
I might do a little work on my master project.

82
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:01,960
绝密哦
Top secret.

83
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:04,940
-可别问我那是什么 -我不会问啦
- So don't you dare ask what it is. - I won't.

84
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,740
自从莉莉上了幼儿园
Since Lily started kindergarten,

85
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:08,488
小卡有了很多空闲时间
Cam's had a lot of free time.

86
00:03:08,488 --> 00:03:11,805
我想劝他找个工作 但是
Now, I-I'd like to suggest he go back to work, but...

87
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:16,140
有历史为鉴 那是个敏感的话题
Historically, uh, that has proved to be a sensitive topic.

88
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:19,920
我们去年夏天给越南那边递交了领养材料
We sent those adoption papers to vietnam last summer.

89
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:22,100
不 感谢你才对
No, thank you very much,

90
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:24,040
请将重点放在我的语气上 而不是用词上
And please remember my tone, not my words.

91
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,340
她说领养宝宝要九个月的时间
She said it could take up to nine months to get a baby.

92
00:03:26,420 --> 00:03:27,100
太不人道了
It's inhuman!

93
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:30,240
是吗 别...我知道这很令人沮丧
Is it? Don't-- I-I know it's frustrating,

94
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:32,460
但或许 与其把自己搞得神经兮兮
But maybe instead of driving yourself crazy

95
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:34,620
傻等着电话铃响 你不如重返工作岗位
Waiting for the phone to ring, you could go back to work.

96
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:35,720
你说什么
Excuse me?

97
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:36,940
去找份工作
Get a job!

98
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:40,780
不 那会将你的注意力从宝宝身上移开
No, it--it'll help you take your mind off the baby.

99
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,400
怎么 因为我是个大块头吃白食的吗
Oh, what, because I'm a big, giant freeloader?

100
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:44,680
其实 我觉得我已经把原因说得很清楚了
Actually, I think I laid out the reasons pretty clearly.

101
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,440
不 我觉得你将我定性为懒到骨子里的人
No, I think you pegged me. Bone lazy,

102
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,780
就像当年在农场 每天第一个上床
Just like on the farm-- first to bed,

103
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,760
早上最后一个起床
last to wake up in the morning.

104
00:03:48,940 --> 00:03:50,080
话说 不如你打电话给我爸
You know what? Why don't you call my dad,

105
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,140
你们两个彻夜长谈一番
And you two can gab all night

106
00:03:51,140 --> 00:03:53,120
尽情笑话我是个吃白食的懒汉
about what a teet-sucking layabout I am?

107
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,880
好吧 我觉得我可能搅痛了
Okay, I think I might have paddled

108
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,166
你心里陈年的旧伤疤
into some deeper waters here.

109
00:03:56,166 --> 00:03:58,020
怎么 你以为我整天闲坐着吗
What, you think I sit around all day?

110
00:03:58,020 --> 00:03:59,040
我现在就不坐了
Well, I'm not sitting now.

111
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,640
什么情况
What's happening?

112
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,360
你早已经打好包了吗
You keep a packed suitcase?

113
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,900
真是个健康的宝宝
That's a healthy baby.

114
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,360
-稍等 -怎么了
- Hold on. - What?

115
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:09,340
那是个车牌和毂盖吗
Is that a license plate and a hubcap?

116
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:11,660
就像电影《大白鲨》里那样
You know, like in "Jaws"?

117
00:04:11,660 --> 00:04:12,660
我从来没看过
I never saw it.

118
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:13,980
我倒是看过 但我不记得
I saw it, but I don't remember

119
00:04:13,980 --> 00:04:15,553
有孕妇怀了个车毂盖的场景啊
a scene with a hubcap in a pregnant woman.

120
00:04:15,553 --> 00:04:16,940
算了
Ah, forget it.

121
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:18,900
你们想知道怀的是男孩还是女孩吗
So, would you like to know if you're having a boy or a girl?

122
00:04:18,900 --> 00:04:20,300
-是的 -不想
- Yes. - No.

123
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:23,280
我希望到时候能有个惊喜
Ay. I want it to be a surprise,

124
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,120
你不想吗 杰
Don't you, Jay?

125
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,860
我65岁高龄再次喜当爹
I'm having a baby at 65.

126
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,800
你还想再来点惊喜吗 歌洛莉亚
You want another surprise, Gloria?

127
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,220
自己去买一袋玉米片吧[内含各种惊喜小玩具]
Buy yourself a box of cracker jacks.

128
00:04:31,136 --> 00:04:33,080
该死的干洗店
Estupid dry cleaners!

129
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,840
把我的衣服都弄缩水了
They shrink my clothes!

130
00:04:35,140 --> 00:04:36,620
或许你该穿孕妇装了
Might be time for maternity wear.

131
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:39,100
你疯了吗 我都没显肚子
Are you crazy? I'm barely showing.

132
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:41,720
亲爱的 你怀孕前 衣服就被大胸撑爆了啊
Sweetheart, your shirts barely fit before you were pregnant.

133
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,200
我可没听你抱怨过太大啊
And I never heard you complain.

134
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:47,020
我们需要一条长一点的裤带
We're gonna need a bigger belt.

135
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:49,620
给力啊
Come on.

136
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:51,560
好难哦
This is hard.

137
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:55,580
嘿 小卡
Hey, Cam.

138
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:56,460
谁饿了呀
Who's hungry?

139
00:04:56,460 --> 00:05:01,291
哎呀呀 你是想过来一起吃饭吧
Ohh! Were you thinking about dropping by for lunch...

140
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:01,980
又来啊
Again?

141
00:05:01,993 --> 00:05:04,078
我真希望我有空
You know, I-I really wish I could,

142
00:05:04,091 --> 00:05:08,300
但这里现在忙得一团乱
But it's, uh, it's a zoo around here.

143
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:10,020
但是 那个 小卡
Um... but, hey, Cam--

144
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:13,300
小卡 你能不能去朗吉娜的时装店
Cam, would you mind, uh, stopping by Longinus' boutique

145
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,800
替我买几件衬衫啊
And picking up a few shirts for me?

146
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,300
-当然可以 -谢啦
- Sure. - Thank you.

147
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,860
或者我们可以一起去
Or we can do it together.

148
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:18,960
-是你啊 -是我啊
- Hey! - Hey!

149
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,120
-你来了 -我来了
- Hi. - Hi.

150
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:21,320
-你还好吗 -很好
- How are you? - Good.

151
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,240
好吧
Okay.

152
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:25,880
那 那很好 好吧
Um... that's-- that's good. Okay. Yeah.

153
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,640
你没把我的绿夹克寄来吗
You didn't send the little green jacket?!

154
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,320
亲爱的 我可不想又遭一次罪
Honey, I am not doing this again.

155
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:31,660
我之前寄那个包裹就花了一小时
It took me an hour to mail that package before.

156
00:05:31,670 --> 00:05:35,090
我患有"邮局"创伤"后"应激障碍症
I have post-post office traumatic stress disorder.

157
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:36,720
别奸笑了 不怎么有水平
Stop smiling. It's not that clever.

158
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,080
很有水平的好吧
It is clever,

159
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,880
反正我今天是死也不会再回去了
and there's no way I'm going back there today.

160
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:41,700
天啊 我恨死你了
Oh, my God, I hate you so much!

161
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,560
抱歉 你爸打电话来了 我得挂了
Oh, sorry, that's your father. Gotta go!

162
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:44,880
克莱尔 你在哪儿
Claire, where are you?

163
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:47,860
亲爱的 我刚刚在邮局的经历糟糕透了
Oh, honey, I just had a hellish experience at the post office.

164
00:05:47,860 --> 00:05:51,576
我患有"邮局"创伤"后"应激障碍症
I have post-post office traumatic stress disorder.

165
00:05:51,576 --> 00:05:53,460
-真经典 -好棒
- Nailed it. - Yes!

166
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:55,220
卢克忘了带他的科学作业
And Luke forgot his science project,

167
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:56,520
所以我现在给他送到学校去
So now I'm at the school dropping it off.

168
00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:59,360
那我在诊所的预约怎么办
Um, but what about my appointment?

169
