你不能走 我们还有女儿
You're not going anywhere. We have a daughter.

344
00:12:37,700 --> 00:12:39,600
不是我走 是你走
It's not for me. It's for you.

345
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:42,000
小卡 我不走 都打包好了
Cam, I'm not go-- okay, well, that's packed.

346
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:43,040
没错 要是你打算去个寒冷的地方
Yeah, and if you're going someplace cool,

347
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:44,360
我还打包了一个冬季版的
I have a winter one packed as well.

348
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,520
不 我哪儿也不去
No, I'm not going anywhere!

349
00:12:45,900 --> 00:12:48,260
而且我要跟你把这些事情说清楚
And I should be able to talk to you about these things.

350
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,160
说什么说
Oh, what things?

351
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:51,280
说我的生活有多空虚吗
How empty my life is?

352
00:12:52,020 --> 00:12:53,760
你根本不知道我每天
You know, you have no idea what I do

353
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:56,220
为这个家都做了什么 我买食材
around this house every day. I shop for food,

354
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,760
我付账单 我收拾屋子
I pay the bills, I maintain the house,

355
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:58,760
我去食杂店
I grocery shop.

356
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,760
跟买食材是一回事
Same as shopping for food.

357
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:02,440
我还要忙活我的大项目
And still I have enough time to work on my master project.

358
00:13:03,980 --> 00:13:06,320
而且你从来不问人家的大项目是什么
And you never ask me what my master project is.

359
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:08,140
是你让我别问的嘛
Because you told me not to ask!

360
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:10,251
好吧 既然你不肯善罢甘休
Fine, since you won't let it go...

361
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,520
这个
Does this...

362
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:17,000
看着像是一个空虚的懒鬼干的活儿吗
look like the work of an unfulfilled slacker?

363
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,500
人鱼装
A mermaid costume?

364
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,060
我亲自设计 手工缝制的
Hand-sewn from my own design.

365
00:13:20,620 --> 00:13:21,860
你缝过莱卡面料的东西吗
Have you ever stitched lycra?

366
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,300
像在水中穿针引线一样 米奇尔
It's like sewing water, Mitchell.

367
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:26,240
貌似莉莉穿有点小
It looks a little small for Lily.

368
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,200
不是给莉莉穿的
It's not for Lily.

369
00:13:28,020 --> 00:13:29,300
是给小猫穿的
It's for the cat.

370
00:13:31,300 --> 00:13:33,040
是有人替小猫做人鱼装的
It's a mermaid costume for the cat.

371
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:37,320
这就是我的大项目
My master project.

372
00:13:38,180 --> 00:13:39,780
这个人鱼装是
It's a mermaid costume...

373
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:41,860
给猫穿的
for a cat!

374
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:43,230
好了 别哭了
Okay. Hey, don't cry, okay?

375
00:13:43,230 --> 00:13:45,360
不 挺漂亮的 这个
No, no, it's--it's nice. It's--

376
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,400
是非常漂亮的猫咪装
It's a very nice cat costume.

377
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:48,760
少来了
Oh, stop it!

378
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:50,840
这是我八个星期的人生啊
This is eight weeks of my life!

379
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:53,786
我愚蠢 空虚 诡异
My--my stupid, empty, creepy,

380
00:13:53,980 --> 00:13:56,100
一无是处 给猫咪打扮的人生
useless cat-dressing life.

381
00:13:56,300 --> 00:13:57,780
我给你拿纸巾 好吗
Let me get you a tissue, all right?

382
00:13:57,780 --> 00:14:00,040
-这里 -好的
- Here. - Okay.

383
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,780
瞧你 还给我打包了纸巾
Oh! You packed me tissues.

384
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:03,500
我知道你过敏了会怎需要用到的
I know how you are with your allergies.

385
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:06,660
小卡 你知道我从来没觉得你懒
Cam! You know I don't think you're lazy.

386
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:09,400
我知道 那只是我对父亲的心结
I know. That's just stupid dad stuff.

387
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:11,060
我只是不喜欢农场的工作
You know, I didn't like working on the farm,

388
00:14:11,060 --> 00:14:12,760
他就说那是因为我懒
and he just took it as me being lazy.

389
00:14:12,760 --> 00:14:15,890
可事实是 我很空虚
The truth is, is I am unfulfilled.

390
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,500
我需要寻找目标
And I do need to find something.

391
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:19,600
你有挑战目标的时候看起来更开心
Well, you just--you seem happier when you have a challenge.

392
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:21,580
-知道吗 -我知道
- You know? - I know, I know.

393
00:14:21,580 --> 00:14:23,804
我喜欢教孩子们音乐
You know, I loved teaching music to kids,

394
00:14:23,804 --> 00:14:27,260
然后莉莉出现在我们的生命中
and then--then Lily, she came along, and...

395
00:14:27,260 --> 00:14:29,340
照顾她是全世界最美妙的工作
That's the best job in the whole wide world.

396
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,540
知道吗 现在她不像从前那样需要我了
You know? And now she doesn't need me as much.

397
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:32,805
好啦 好啦
No, come on, come on.

398
00:14:32,805 --> 00:14:35,140
我们再替你找目标 好吗
We're gonna find you something else, all right?

399
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:36,660
不一定得去朗吉娜的店
And it doesn't have to be Longinus.

400
00:14:37,763 --> 00:14:39,840
-或者这个 -好的
- Or this. - Yeah.

401
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,540
其实 我真的很喜欢他家的衬衫
You know, I do like these shirts.

402
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,320
知道 知道
Yeah. Yeah.

403
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:44,280
我得想想
Mulling.

404
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:46,540
-好吧 -如果我真要想清楚
- Okay. - You know, if I'm gonna mull,

405
00:14:46,540 --> 00:14:47,500
我得吃点巧克力
I could really use some chocolate.

406
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,460
因为你在节食 所以家里没存货
Well, since your diet, we don't keep it around the house.

407
00:14:49,540 --> 00:14:51,500
-侧袋里 -是吗 真有
- Side pocket. - Yeah? Oh.

408
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:54,036
-提醒我补货 -好的
- Remind me to replace these. - Okay.

409
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,160
是你啊 杰 你好吗
Oh. Hey, Jay! How you doing?

410
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:01,680
菲尔 你不能这样遇事就逃跑
Phil, you gotta stop running from things because--

411
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:02,960
逃跑 我没在跑
Running? I'm not running.

412
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:05,140
-你才是在跑 -听着 我不会再兜个圈了
- You're running. - Look, I'm not up for another round with this.

413
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:07,340
快给我上车 我今天很不爽
Just get in the damn car! I'm not having a great day!

414
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:08,720
你今天不爽
You're not having a great day?!

415
00:15:09,020 --> 00:15:11,300
你马上会像雪纳瑞犬一样被取掉卵巢吗
Are you about to get spayed like a common schnauzer?!

416
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,560
不是取掉卵巢 是输精管结扎 你是个爷们儿
They don't spay you, they fix you. You're a man!

417
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,797
我只想一直当个爷们儿
I just want to stay one!

418
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:22,200
菲尔 你到底怕什么
Phil, what's scaring you here?

419
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:24,220
怕人家觉得你不够爷们儿了吗
That people are gonna think less of you as a man?

420
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:26,169
不 我怕会很痛
No, I'm afraid it's gonna hurt.

421
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:28,480
-原来是这样啊 -慢着 人家会那么想吗
- That's what this is about? - Wait, people think that?

422
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,820
会觉得我不够爷们儿了吗
That you're less of a man?

423
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:32,480
我还没想到这点呢
That never even occurred to me.

424
00:15:33,914 --> 00:15:36,540
听着 没人会就此看轻你
Look, no one's gonna think less of you.

425
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:37,980
而且根本不痛
And it hardly even hurts.

426
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,720
我下面非常敏感
I'm unusually sensitive down there.

427
00:15:40,020 --> 00:15:41,680
有些按摩浴缸都不能用
I can't go in certain jacuzzis.

428
00:15:41,692 --> 00:15:43,680
整个过程我都会陪着你的
I'm gonna be with you the entire way.

429
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,440
而且对疼痛的恐惧
Plus it's the fear of pain

430
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:47,920
总是比实际的疼痛要夸张得多
that's always more than the actual experience.

431
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:50,240
你说这话当然容易 你向来天不怕地不怕
That's easy for you to say. You're not afraid of anything.

432
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:51,840
-我当然也有害怕的 -说来听听
-Of course I'm afraid of stuff. - Like what?

433
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:56,760
听着
Look...

434
00:15:57,953 --> 00:15:59,768
你还记得之前 我告诉你
You remember before, when I told you I was

435
00:15:59,768 --> 00:16:02,329
我想知道 宝宝的性别
wanting to know the-- the sex of the baby...

436
00:16:02,996 --> 00:16:05,109
为了处理好一些实际的问题 其实不是的
For practical matters? Well, that wasn't true.

437
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:07,560
我有些害怕生个女儿
I'm kind of afraid of having a girl.

438
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:09,880
少来了 这算什么问题
Give me a break. That's not a thing.

439
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:11,560
你只是更想要个儿子而已
You'd just rather have a boy.

440
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,580
大家都更想要儿子
Everyone would rather have a boy.

441
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,140
不 我是真害怕 我很了解男孩
No. I'm actually scared. I get boys.

442
00:16:16,140 --> 00:16:18,480
只是女孩儿们 太复杂了
It's girls-- they're--they're complicated.

443
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,600
克莱尔童年的一半时间 我竭尽所能地
Half of Claire's childhood, I did everything I could

444
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,800
想将她变成男孩
to try to turn her into a boy.

445
00:16:22,620 --> 00:16:24,840
无论你当年有什么心结
Well, whatever your issues were,

446
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:25,980
你和克莱尔现在很好啊
you and Claire are good now.

447
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,800
但我可能没那么多时间陪着
Yeah, but I may not get that kind of time

448
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:29,520
那个新出生的孩子 我不能搞砸了
with this new one, and I can't screw it up.

449
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:33,980
我不觉得自己体贴入微到可以养女儿
I don't think I'm sensitive enough to raise a girl.

450
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:36,200
杰 你现在就很体贴入微啊
Jay, you're being sensitive right now.

451
00:16:37,100 --> 00:16:39,660
我都歇斯底里了 而你让我冷静了下来
I mean, I was pretty hysterical, and you calmed me down.

452
00:16:39,920 --> 00:16:41,720
我觉得你和以前不一样了
I-I don't think you're the guy you used to be.

453
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:43,660
你这是在说 如果我能应付你
So you're saying that if I can deal with you,

454
00:16:43,660 --> 00:16:46,560
我就能应付 其他任何一个小女孩
then I can handle... any other little girl?

455
00:16:47,019 --> 00:16:48,397
我觉得你暗示我像小女孩一样是不合适的
I think I'd put it a-a little differently.

456
00:16:48,397 --> 00:16:51,531
不 我觉得就是这样
No, I-I-I think that's right.

457
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:53,160
多谢了
Thanks.

458
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,160
要去做手术吗
We gonna do this?

459
00:16:57,540 --> 00:16:59,040
向我保证不会那么痛
Promise it's not gonna hurt that much?

460
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,520
就像轻轻掐一下
Tiny, little pinch.

461
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:01,940
-我是自己吓自己 对吗 -绝对的
- I built it up in my head, didn't I? - Totally.

462
00:17:02,308 --> 00:17:05,780
我依然可以拥有完全满足的...
And I can still achieve a-a full and satisfying...

463
00:17:05,780 --> 00:17:07,580
知道吗 我们爷俩儿现在处的很不错
You know what? We had a nice little moment here.

464
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:08,460
这样的时候不多
We don't have many of those.

465
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,580
我要让这一刻永存
I think I'm gonna commemorate it.

466
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:12,980
-好的 -准备好了吗
- Okay. - All right?

467
00:17:12,980 --> 00:17:13,780
坐直了
So sit up straight.

468
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:16,240
来拍一张
There you go.

469
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:19,200
别别 手臂放下 手臂放下好些
No, no, the arms down. Uh, better arms down.

470
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:20,320
没错 对对对
All right. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

471
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:21,440
就那样挺好 放松
That's right. Relax.

472
00:17:22,260 --> 00:17:23,200
看这里
There you go.

473
00:17:25,320 --> 00:17:25,800
完美
Perfect.

474
00:17:26,080 --> 00:17:26,740
能洗一张给我吗
Can I get a copy?

475
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:27,980
会洗很多张的
Oh, there'll be a lot of copies.

476
00:17:28,260 --> 00:17:28,860
太好了
Oh, great.

477
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:32,800
你对那个卖肉桂面包的家伙有些刻薄啊
You were kind of hard on that cinnamon bun guy.

478
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:34,540
你听到他对我说什么了吗
Did you hear what he said to me?

479
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:35,340
"恭喜"
"Congratulations"?

480
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,520
他看出我怀孕了
He thinks I'm pregnant!

481
00:17:38,180 --> 00:17:40,940
那简直是对没有孕状的人的一种侮辱
That is an insult when the person doesn't look it.

482
00:17:41,760 --> 00:17:42,360
妈 等一下
Mom, wait.

483
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,280
你得听我说
You need to hear this.

484
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:47,680
你怀孕了 而且显肚子了
You are pregnant, and you look it.

485
00:17:48,660 --> 00:17:52,200
我希望肚子里的新宝宝能更懂礼貌些
I hope that this new one has some good manners!

486
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,600
妈 停下
Mom, stop!

487
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:57,880
我知道这一切对你来说有些可怕
I know this whole thing is a little scary for you.

488
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:00,080
你上次怀孕时 基本是一个人挺过来的
Last time you were pregnant, you kinda did it alone

489
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:01,820
因为爸爸不怎么在你身边
'cause dad wasn't around much.

490
00:18:01,820 --> 00:18:03,600
但这次你有两个伴在身边
But this time you have two partners.

491
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,000
真甜蜜
That's sweet.

492
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,340
你也是个小甜心
And so are you.

493
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:13,180
特别是你脸上还沾着点糖
Especially with a little bit of sugar in your face.

494
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:14,700
我看看
Let me see.

495
00:18:17,042 --> 00:18:18,361
怎么回事
Ohh! What happened?!

496
00:18:18,361 --> 00:18:19,613
你的衣服实在是太小撑不住了
Your shirt couldn't take it anymore!

497
00:18:19,613 --> 00:18:21,821
都怪那傻逼干洗员
The stupid dry cleaners!

498
00:18:21,821 --> 00:18:23,198
它 它在哪儿
W-- where is it?!

499
00:18:23,198 --> 00:18:23,838
不
Ay, no!

500
00:18:23,838 --> 00:18:25,310
这下你真没辙了
Oh! You're running out of arms, mom!

501
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:27,222
那边正好有一家母婴店
A maternity store's right over there!

502
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:29,980
-那是什么 -我不知道 不过我们快走吧
- What was that? - I don't know, but let's go!

503
00:18:31,146 --> 00:18:34,600
是你啊 我还以为给我剃毛的人来了呢
It's you. I thought it was the guy coming to shave me.

504
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:35,540
太好了 他们还没开始
Oh, good. They haven't started.

505
00:18:36,060 --> 00:18:38,080
他的脖子上还有一小张草纸
He had a little piece of bloody toilet paper on his neck.

506
00:18:38,100 --> 00:18:38,980
真叫人不安
It was disconcerting.

507
00:18:40,860 --> 00:18:42,100
-你还好吗 -嗯
- Are you okay? - Mm-hmm.

508
00:18:42,660 --> 00:18:44,240
不错 今天真是疯狂的一天
Yeah. I had a pretty crazy day,

509
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:46,500
但是 到最后很有趣
But it--it had an interesting ending.

510
00:18:46,500 --> 00:18:49,460
而那只海龟200岁了
And this tortoise was 200 years old.

511
00:18:49,460 --> 00:18:51,280
抱歉 老是讲我的旅行让你挺无聊吧
I'm sorry. I'm boring you with my trip.

512
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:52,440
不会啊 一点也不无聊
No, not at all.

513
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:54,780
你的热气球穿越了活火山
You hot-air-ballooned over an active volcano.

514
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:57,560
三星期前我在杰斐逊一路畅通
Three weeks ago I made every green light on Jefferson.

515
00:18:57,580 --> 00:18:58,700
我一说就停不下来嘴
Couldn't stop talking about it.

516
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:01,446
-你发邮件给我说过了 -天啊
- You e-mailed me. - Oh, god.

517
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:07,260
妈妈把斯凯勒的头发给剃了 真搞笑
Mom shaved Skylar's head? That's hilarious!

518
00:19:07,340 --> 00:19:10,440
